  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"572\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"207\">• About our brand and products:</strong><br data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"210\">Moodringcolors.com is a playful, mood-driven jewelry brand focused on color-changing mood rings that reflect your feelings in real time. Our rings are more than just accessories—they’re conversation starters, nostalgic throwbacks, and emotional check-ins you can wear. Loved by Gen Z and Millennials alike, our best-sellers blend style with emotional expression.</p><hr data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"577\"><p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"899\"><strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"609\">• What makes us different:</strong><br data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"612\">We combine vintage charm with modern aesthetics to create rings that feel magical and meaningful. With gorgeous packaging, mood color charts, and daily mood-boosting designs, we stand out in the growing trend of feel-good fashion. Our customers love the vibe—and they come back for more!</p><hr data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"904\"><p data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"1153\"><strong data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"936\">• How affiliates can earn:</strong><br data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"939\">Earn <strong data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"962\">15% commission</strong> on every successful sale driven through your link or coupon code. Top performers also get bonus rewards, early access to new launches, and exclusive giveaways. We’re here to grow <em data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1148\">with</em> you.</p><hr data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1158\"><p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1432\"><strong data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1184\">• How to promote us:</strong><br data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1187\">Share your affiliate link or personal coupon code on Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, Pinterest, or your blog. Highlight unboxing, color-changing magic, styling tips, or gift ideas—our product does the rest. Don’t forget to tag us @moodringcolors 💍✨</p><hr data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1437\"><p data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1646\"><strong data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1463\">• Other information:</strong><br data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1466\">Our average order value is $30–150, and we ship internationally. This program is open to creators of all sizes—micro-influencers welcome! Let’s build something colorful together. 🌈</p></div></div>",
